 ### Fixed

 - Offer a configurable RAM icon and percentage beside the other status icons, with tappable diagnostics and migration of previous visibility preferences.
+- Use PSRAM for compressed-dictionary history and admit PSRAM-backed dictionary fonts with 40 KiB of internal headroom while retaining the non-PSRAM safety gate. Keep dictionary glyph caches alive through selection overlays and place compressed-font pixel buffers in PSRAM when available. Restore the requested Arabic dictionary font after network use instead of silently drawing with the Latin reader font.
+
+- Keep Settings lists and Font Options clear of the shared bottom app ribbon, including calibrated edges.

 - Fix an occasional reboot when putting an X3 or X4 to sleep with plugins enabled (#973).
 - Index EPUBs faster when many table-of-contents entries point to the same chapter file or chapter files are stored out of reading order.
